---
name: web-dev-port
enabled: true
event: bash
action: warn
conditions:
  - field: command
    operator: regex_match
    pattern: npm run dev|next dev
  - field: command
    operator: not_contains
    pattern: "{{ harness_dev_web_port }}"
  - field: command
    operator: not_contains
    pattern: collab
---

ATTENTION: this project's web dev runs on port **{{ harness_dev_web_port }}**{% if harness_reserved_ports %} (ports reserved for another local tool: {{ harness_reserved_ports }} — do not start dev on them without the port flag){% endif %}.

Canonical: `cd {{ harness_web_app_dir }} && npm run dev -- -p {{ harness_dev_web_port }}`{% if project_name %} — or the `run-{{ project_name }}` skill, if filled in for this project (brings up infra+API+web idempotently and validates health; the generic `dev-doctor` only has the `status`/`reap` modes, it does not bring up the stack){% endif %}.
